# =============================================================================
# AI Provider Configuration
# =============================================================================
# Configure one or both providers. Each provider offers different capabilities.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 1: Google AI Studio (Gemini)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Get your API key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#
# Capabilities:
#   - Text: Gemini 3.5 Flash / 3.1 Pro
#   - Image: Gemini 3 Image (Nano Banana)
#   - Video: Veo 3.1 (lite/fast/standard quality tiers)
#   - TTS: Gemini TTS (30 voices)
#   - Music: Lyria (background music, jingles)
#
# Single key:
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-api-key-here
#
# Multiple keys (for rate limit rotation):
# GEMINI_API_KEYS=key1,key2,key3
#
# --- Vertex AI mode (optional, bypasses AI Studio spending caps) ---
# Bills Gemini calls through your GCP project instead of AI Studio keys.
# Requires: gcloud auth application-default login (ADC). API keys are ignored
# while this is on.
# GEMINI_USE_VERTEX=true
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=your-gcp-project-id
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION=global

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 2: OpenRouter
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Get your API key at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
#
# Capabilities (91-model synced catalog — openrouter/pricing.json):
#   - Text:  25 curated ids (GPT-5.6 Luna, GPT-4.1, Claude 4, Llama 4, DeepSeek V4)
#   - Image: 40 models (Seedream 4.5, FLUX.2, Recraft v4.1, GPT Image, Qwen Image 3)
#   - Video: 22 models — Seedance 2.0 (native lip-sync, integrated audio),
#            Veo 3.1, Kling v3, Wan 2.7, Hailuo 3, Runway Gen-4.5, Sora 2 Pro
#   - Audio: GPT Audio / Audio Mini (speech), Lyria 3 (song + clip)
#   - STT:   audio-capable chat models (openai/gpt-audio-mini) — there is NO
#            Whisper endpoint on OpenRouter; Gemini transcribeAudio is preferred
#
# Browse + price models for free (local reads, no API call):
#   node workflows/cli.cjs listOpenRouterModels '["video"]'
#   node workflows/cli.cjs estimateOpenRouterCost '{"model":"google/veo-3.1-fast","durationSeconds":8}'
# Refresh the catalog: node openrouter/scripts/sync-pricing.mjs  (--check = drift only)
#
# Single key:
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-key-here
#
# Multiple keys (for rate limit rotation):
# OPENROUTER_API_KEYS=key1,key2,key3
#
# Optional attribution headers sent with every OpenRouter request:
# OPENROUTER_REFERER=http://localhost   # HTTP-Referer header (default: http://localhost)
# OPENROUTER_TITLE=AI App               # X-Title header (default: "AI App")

# =============================================================================
# RunPod (optional) — get key: https://www.runpod.io/console/user/settings
# New account? Sign up via https://runpod.io?ref=z1r0sgie (referral link —
# load $10+ and get a one-time $5-500 bonus credit; most receive $5-10.
# Supports this project. Plain signup: https://runpod.io)
# =============================================================================
# Enables infiniteTalkLipsync: TRUE lip-sync of a character image to a
# PROVIDED audio file (user voice recordings/clones). Flat pricing per
# request: 480p $0.25 · 720p $0.50. No duration cap observed (13s+ ok).
#
# RUNPOD_API_KEY=rpa_your-key-here

# =============================================================================
# Provider Selection Guide
# =============================================================================
#
# BOTH CONFIGURED:
#   - Gemini: Best for video (Veo/Omni), music (Lyria), transcription, native
#     Google quality — everything in the kit is tuned for it
#   - OpenRouter: Best for Seedance (lip-sync) and model variety (91 models)
#
# ONLY GEMINI:
#   - Full video, image, TTS, music, transcription support
#   - No Seedance lip-sync, no GPT-4/Claude access
#
# ONLY OPENROUTER:
#   - Video, image, text, speech, Lyria 3 music via the catalog
#   - Skills, prompt guides, and presets assume Gemini — expect rough edges

# =============================================================================
# Budget Enforcement
# =============================================================================
# The CLI hard-stops paid commands once a project hits its budget cap
# (BUDGET_EXCEEDED). To bypass the cap for ONE user-approved run, set
# BUDGET_OVERRIDE=1 per invocation — do NOT set it here permanently:
#   BUDGET_OVERRIDE=1 node workflows/cli.cjs <command> '<json-args>'
# See workflows/WORKFLOWS.md.
